  "lapsed_date": "05/02/2028",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<div>The proposed two-storey side extension, by reason of the bulk, mass, scale siting and design, would present an overly bulky and dominant development, appearing more akin to a seperate dwelling,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">detracting from the uniformity and visual harmony of the terrace.</span></div><div>As such, the proposed development is contrary to:</div><div><br></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-\r\n</span>National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- Policy D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (March 2021)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p><span pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of&nbsp;</span>The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p><br></p></div>",
    "<div>The scale and siting of the proposed development would result in an unacceptable loss of daylight, outlook and increased overbearing impact to neighbouring occupiers especially no.241 Salisbury Avenue, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:<br></div><div><br></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">-&nbsp;</span>National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, December 2024)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- Policy\r\nD4 of the London Plan (March 2021);</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of&nbsp;</span>The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s&nbsp;</span>Local Plan (September 2024)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \" pt=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p><br></p></div>"
  ],
